__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store
*.code-workspace
.claude/plans/
.design-loop/
!vscode/workspace.template.code-workspace

# BMad is installed locally, but only repository-owned customizations and
# intentionally published artifacts are versioned. See docs/bmad.md.
/_bmad/*
!/_bmad/custom/
!/_bmad/custom/**
/.agents/
/.claude/skills/
/.github/agents/

# Research runs: the four curated-list README copies are other projects' text and stay local; digests carry the extracted claims.
_bmad-output/planning-artifacts/research/**/imports/list-*.md

# Harness bookkeeping the CLI writes into whatever checkout it runs in: a task record
# keyed to an absolute repository path, the sync lock, and captured cost-replay
# transcripts. None can ever be committed. Plans and progress stay visible under
# .agent-harness/, because a handoff counts them as task inputs.
.agent-harness/task.json
.agent-harness/sync.lock
.agent-harness/evidence/
